<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;I was previously given the example:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;code&gt;
my $subscribers = $ua-&gt;get( $url )-&gt;result-&gt;json-&gt;{subscribers_count};
&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;p&gt;which I modified (based on &lt;a href="https://www.w3schools.com/js/js_json_objects.asp"&gt;this JSON Tutorial&lt;/a&gt;) to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;code&gt;
my $feedurl = $ua-&gt;get($url)-&gt;result-&gt;json-&gt;{feeds.meta.links.feed};
&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;p&gt;which gave error message:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;code&gt;
Bareword "feeds" not allowed while "strict subs" in use
&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I'll keep exploring but would appreciate any hints.&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
